{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 0,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm here at the Navy's\nIndoor Ocean at Carderock."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4320,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the biggest wave pool in the world"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6450,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they can make all\nkinds of different waves"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9030,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so they can test scale\nships and make them better"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 13170,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "before they actually go\nout on the open ocean."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 16350,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I came in and I'd seen some pictures,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 18210,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I just walked in here\nand it's just, it's insane."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21780,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "'Cause they say indoor ocean,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 23130,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it's exactly what it is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 24870,
    "dDurationMs": 2805,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The water even looks ocean colored."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 27675,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(laughing)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 28508,
    "dDurationMs": 1252,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It doesn't look like a swimming pool,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 29760,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this looks like an ocean,\nlooks like a test facility."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 32970,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is huge."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 34740,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It is 360 feet long in this dimension,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 37110,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "240 feet long in that dimension."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 39300,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's 20 feet deep."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 40560,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just about the size of a\nfootball field out there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 42600,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The dome above us was the\nlargest free standing dome"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 45090,
    "dDurationMs": 930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for a while."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46020,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] Largest free\nstanding dome in the world?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 47490,
    "dDurationMs": 870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yep."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 48360,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- What?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 49193,
    "dDurationMs": 847,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(Miguel laughs)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50040,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In this pool they can make\nwaves of all shapes and sizes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53550,
    "dDurationMs": 4650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "using huge paddles that\nline two walls of the pool."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 58200,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- We have 216 individual wave makers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 60990,
    "dDurationMs": 4230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We can make waves from -45\ndegrees up to 135 degrees,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 65220,
    "dDurationMs": 2050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is kind of coming right back at it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 68760,
    "dDurationMs": 4170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- We are now behind the big\npaddles that make the waves."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 72930,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These 216 paddles are programmed to move"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 77430,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in incredibly well choreographed ways"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 80010,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so that they can produce reproducible,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 83070,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "perfect sized, perfect frequency waves"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 85440,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that go across the entire pool."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 87480,
    "dDurationMs": 1230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- You can see these air bellows"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 88710,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that are what's making the angular motion."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 91320,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That vertical piece is\nthe force transducer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 93720,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The other force transducer's\nright up on the top."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 96690,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] There are lots\nof wave pools in the world,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 99180,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but what makes this one\ndifferent is control."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 102450,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can create waves of a\nspecific amplitude and frequency"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 105990,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and do so repeatedly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 108090,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Can we try a one Hertz?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 109560,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Miguel] Yeah. Do me a\nfavor and dial up one Hertz."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 113220,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Operator] Amplitude\nwill be 0.078 at one Hertz."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 117180,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Okay, go ahead and\nsend it from zero please."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 119700,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so this is the largest\nwave we can make, at one Hertz."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 122550,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's based on the motion\nand power requirement"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 125460,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for the wave maker."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127500,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] There's something a bit surreal"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 128790,
    "dDurationMs": 870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about watching this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 129660,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "'cause it almost looks like an ocean"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 133080,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "except you never see waves\nthis regular out there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 136650,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Miguel] Yeah, correct."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 138270,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- One of the fundamental characteristics"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 139830,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of a wave is its wavelength,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 141570,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the distance from one crest to the next."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 144300,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The first thing most people learn"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 145740,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about waves is they transmit energy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 148230,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "rather than material from\none place to another."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 151290,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In this case, as the wave\ntravels to the right,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 153870,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the water molecules themselves\nbasically move along"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156990,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "circular paths."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 158280,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the deeper the water,\nthe smaller this motion."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 161610,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All motion stops at a depth\nequal to half the wavelength."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 165630,
    "dDurationMs": 2583,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is known as the wave base."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 169350,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But even in an ideal water wave,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 171570,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the molecules do drift a bit"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 173580,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the direction of wave motion."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 175170,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is because the\nmolecules travel faster"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 177690,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the higher up they are."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 179130,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So they move farther at\nthe top of their loop"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 181740,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than they move backwards at the bottom,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 183960,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "creating a spiral path."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 186930,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This place is perfect\nfor observing properties"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 189570,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of different waves."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 190860,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I asked Miguel to show me some waves"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 192660,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with different frequencies\nbut the same amplitude."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 195390,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So what I'll have him do now is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 196650,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'll have him stop this wave\nand just change the frequency."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 200310,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "'Cause we're at .6, we'll go to .5,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 201720,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so it'll be a two second wave."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 204720,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Here I'm split screening\nwaves with frequencies"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 207090,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of .67, .5, and .33 Hertz,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 210870,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all with the same amplitude."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 213240,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So two things to notice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 214830,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even though they all\nhave the same amplitude,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 216990,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the ones with higher frequency"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 218760,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "look like they have a greater amplitude"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 220830,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because the slope of the waves is steeper."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 223710,
    "dDurationMs": 4290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And second, the frequency\nof a wave affects its speed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 228000,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "High frequency waves travel\nslower than low frequency waves."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 231960,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In fact, as long as the water\nis deeper than the wave base,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 235110,
    "dDurationMs": 3183,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "wave speed is inversely\nproportional to its frequency."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 239430,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They have a really cool demo"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 241050,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that takes advantage\nof the different speeds"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 242880,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of different frequency waves."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 244740,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can see it starting here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 246960,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They send out high frequency waves first"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 249240,
    "dDurationMs": 3870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "followed by lower and\nlower frequency waves."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 253110,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And because the high\nfrequency waves travel slower,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 255930,
    "dDurationMs": 2733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the lower frequency\nwaves gradually catch up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 259536,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whoa."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 263220,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And they've timed it so\nthat all the waves meet up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 265860,
    "dDurationMs": 2697,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at exactly the same time\nand place in the pool,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 268557,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and this causes the wave to break."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 271560,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The ocean engineers can do this again"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 275760,
    "dDurationMs": 1503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and again,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 278370,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in exactly the same way,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 280290,
    "dDurationMs": 3033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "thanks to their precise\ncontrol over the waves."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 284160,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This demo also nicely illustrates"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 285990,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the principle of superposition,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 287580,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that when waves meet they add together."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 290340,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The height of the water is\nequal to the sum of the heights"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 293220,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the individual waves\nmeeting at that point."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 296550,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can see how much\nbigger the amplitude is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 299160,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Those individual waves weren't that big,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 301590,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but when you add them all together,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 303300,
    "dDurationMs": 2223,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can make this big breaking wave."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 307230,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They can also take advantage\nof the superposition principle"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 309720,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to create standing waves."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 311820,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So what's coming up\nnext are two regular waves"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 313680,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "coming at each other."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 315180,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What we call the quilt wave."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 316590,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we're gonna have a wave coming this way"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 318030,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and a wave going this way,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 319350,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it's gonna create standing waves."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 321030,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So there's two regular waves coming out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 322620,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and if you look at the wave,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 323940,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it looks like a big\nquilt pattern out there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 326850,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- At some places in the pool,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 328200,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the waves always cancel\nout to zero amplitude,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 331500,
    "dDurationMs": 3813,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and at other places the waves\nadd up for maximum amplitude."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 336600,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They can even send waves\nfrom all directions,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 338880,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so they form circular wave fronts"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 341310,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then all the wave energy\nis channeled into one spot"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 344550,
    "dDurationMs": 1233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they call the bullseye."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 347400,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- And so now we're gonna\nrun the bullseye wave"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 349080,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is essentially the same thing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 350430,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but instead of having a line of waves,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 352530,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we're having it all coalesce\nat one individual point."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 355920,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you can start seeing the waves are"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 357180,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "coming from the long bank here,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 359100,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you can see they're\nmaking a spherical wave."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 361260,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then you have another spherical wave"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 362670,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "coming from the short bank."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 364440,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is breaking due\nto the coalescing waves,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 367920,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the wave height being more than"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 369840,
    "dDurationMs": 1653,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one seventh of the wavelength."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 372750,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- We tried throwing some toys"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 374370,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "into the wave to see what\nwould happen to them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 376710,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Would they get pushed\ninto the breaking wave?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 379710,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even though there's not much\nnet movement of the water,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 382350,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the ducky drifts with the waves,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 384420,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and pretty quickly is\npushed into the bullseye."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 388546,
    "dDurationMs": 1385,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How's the ducky doing?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 389931,
    "dDurationMs": 969,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(Miguel laughs)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 390900,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- He's getting to the\ndanger zone right now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 393540,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's starting to funnel him\nright into that breaking wave."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 396360,
    "dDurationMs": 1821,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ooh, it's getting up, getting up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 400896,
    "dDurationMs": 1505,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Miguel] Oh!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 402401,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(laughs) It swamped it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 403234,
    "dDurationMs": 866,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] That's amazing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 404100,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- That was right where we wanted it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 407100,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] Now the real\npurpose of this facility"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 408780,
    "dDurationMs": 3990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is not to play with toys or\nmake perfect unnatural waves."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 412770,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is to replicate on a small scale"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 415140,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the types of waves Navy\nships will encounter"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 417660,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the oceans of the world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 420270,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Research engineers place\nships modeled after"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 422820,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "billion dollar vessels in the water"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 424650,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to see how different\ndesigns actually behave"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 427260,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in real world conditions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 429030,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Miguel] Right now this\nis coming from 45 degrees."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 431010,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's gonna be about a five\ninch significant wave height,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 434490,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which if we were to scale\nit up for this model"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 436260,
    "dDurationMs": 1593,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "would be 20 foot waves."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 437853,
    "dDurationMs": 2037,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When we're doing a free\nrunning model like this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 439890,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we usually run a race track,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 441540,
    "dDurationMs": 2715,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like a big circle or a figure eight track,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 444255,
    "dDurationMs": 2513,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so we know the headings\nthat we're running in,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 446768,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so that we can correlate that\nto the full scale vessel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 451630,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] For the model to provide"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 452770,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "an accurate representation\nof the real world,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 455170,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a lot of things must\nbe taken into account."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 458140,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is the water fresh?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 460030,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Fresh water."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 460863,
    "dDurationMs": 1357,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] Okay, not salty."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 462220,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Nope. Fresh water."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 463480,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So when you're in salty water,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 465190,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you're gonna have a lot more buoyancy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 466810,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So when we're balasting our models,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 468130,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we have to make sure that\nthey take into account"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 470350,
    "dDurationMs": 870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that buoyancy difference."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 471220,
    "dDurationMs": 3750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So when we go full scale\nyou're in the same conditions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 474970,
    "dDurationMs": 1230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] For fluid mechanics,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 476200,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I always expect that you have\nto keep the Reynolds number"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 478360,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the same as in the real world phenomena."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 480760,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But actually to get the\nright wave dynamics,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 483610,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you have to use a different scaling"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 485440,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is based on the Froude number."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 488170,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the Froude number is a measure"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 489820,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the ratio of inertial\nto gravitational forces."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 493420,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's equal to the flow velocity divided"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 496000,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by the square root of the\nacceleration due to gravity"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 498850,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "times the characteristic length,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 500710,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like the length of the ship."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 502180,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In this case, the model ship's hull"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 504070,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is 46 times smaller than the real thing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 507040,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which means to get accurate data,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 509200,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it should be traveling at one\nover the square root of 46"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 512740,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "times it's real world speed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 514870,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And to make the footage from the model"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 516280,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "look the same as that\nfrom the full size ship,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 518680,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you have to slow it down"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 519940,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by a factor of the square root of 46."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 522640,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So roughly 6.8 times slower."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 526030,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm amazed at just how\nwell these shots match,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 529570,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but of course that's the idea."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 531250,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Scale the model and the the waves,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 532930,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so the physics are\nidentical to a real ship"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 535660,
    "dDurationMs": 1443,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "out on the open ocean."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 538330,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Naturally, I asked if I could\ngo swimming in the pool,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 541840,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but they said, very kindly, \"No way.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 545230,
    "dDurationMs": 3630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The closest I could get\nwould be on a little dingy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 548860,
    "dDurationMs": 850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is our boat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 550900,
    "dDurationMs": 1203,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With a catch."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 553270,
    "dDurationMs": 2476,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's pretty smooth sailing\nout here right now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 555746,
    "dDurationMs": 2807,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- (laughs) Yep. No waves\nwhile we're out here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 559750,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] So I'm assuming\nno one's ever been out here"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 563050,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in waves?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 564190,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Nope. That's one of the\nno-nos they don't want us to do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 567190,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I guess it's a risk thing, so..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 569320,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- This place seems like a... I don't know"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 571270,
    "dDurationMs": 2395,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like a massive playground kind of."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 573665,
    "dDurationMs": 875,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(Miguel laughs)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 574540,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It kind of is for engineers like us"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 576160,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where we kind of dork out on the science"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 578860,
    "dDurationMs": 870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and what we're doing here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 579730,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a huge volume."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 582160,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like I guess I never understood\nhow deep 20 feet was,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 584620,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "until they emptied it to\nput in the new wave makers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 587290,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a large volume that's\ntaken up by this water."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 592330,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 593163,
    "dDurationMs": 1807,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So as we come by, these\nare our sensors right here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 594970,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We have a big array here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 597070,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These are ultrasonic sensors,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 598270,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that's how we measure wave height"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 599530,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and period and direction in the basin."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 601900,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we wanna measure that to\nmake sure that what we test in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 604600,
    "dDurationMs": 1629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is what we think we have."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 606880,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] In this pool, they can create"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 608350,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all sorts of different wave\nconditions you might encounter"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 611020,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in different parts of the world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 613510,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Most ocean waves are created by wind"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 616480,
    "dDurationMs": 3990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the strongest winds\noccur in and around storms."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 620470,
    "dDurationMs": 3690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Five factors affect the size\nand shape of waves created."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 624160,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These are the wind\nspeed, the wind duration,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 628300,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the distance over which\nthe wind is acting,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 630760,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is known as the fetch,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 632920,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the width of the fetch,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 634840,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the depth of the water."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 637030,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As waves travel out from a storm,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 639610,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the higher frequency waves"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 640990,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "dissipate their energy more quickly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 642940,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the waves that travel a long way"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 644890,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are the fast moving low frequency waves,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 647860,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which are called swell."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 649600,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- When those waves end up\nbecoming hundreds of miles away,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 652270,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like if you have it in the Pacific,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 653830,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "eventually you'll get long\nperiod swell from them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 656110,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you're no longer near the storm,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 658750,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it created enough\nenergy to make long waves,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 660820,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that's where you get\nyour open ocean swell."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 662740,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Tell me if this is a good analogy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 664570,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I feel like with sound, a\nlot of the high frequencies"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 667960,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "will die off quickly away from a source."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 670570,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yep."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 671403,
    "dDurationMs": 1267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] But the low frequencies\nwill travel much further."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 672670,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Correct."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 673503,
    "dDurationMs": 1417,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So is it the same thing with the waves?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 674920,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's like you're walking\naway from a concert,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 676720,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you can still hear the bass,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 678700,
    "dDurationMs": 1678,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but you can't see any\nof the high frequencies."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 680378,
    "dDurationMs": 1562,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- That's a great analogy. Yep."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 681940,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- What's the deal with rogue waves?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 684220,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- People like to think it's a rogue wave"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 685900,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where it just came outta\nnowhere and just came up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 687850,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No, it's usually multiple\nwaves that are meeting up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 690640,
    "dDurationMs": 2643,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and creating an amplitude\nthat's much larger"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 693283,
    "dDurationMs": 2877,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than what the self-standing wave would be."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 696160,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So when it meets it's gonna break,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 697870,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because you have this large wave"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 699670,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "creating this huge amplitude"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 701260,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that it just can't hold it and it breaks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 704200,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] On a calm day,\nwhen you see waves crashing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 706840,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at the beach around 10 seconds apart,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 709060,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that is swell."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 710920,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But because of its long wavelength,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 712900,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "swell isn't really a concern for ships"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 715000,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "out in the open ocean."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 716860,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- You know, if you're\nin a long period swell,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 718240,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your ship's probably just\ngonna heave a little bit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 720220,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You're more worried about the steep waves"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 721900,
    "dDurationMs": 930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the windy waves"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 722830,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that are really moving you around."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 726070,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] Wind waves are\nformed in three steps."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 729010,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First, as wind blows across the surface"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 731530,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of perfectly still water,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 733240,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the turbulent motion of\nthe air creates regions"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 736000,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of slightly higher and\nslightly lower pressure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 738970,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this makes tiny ripples"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 740890,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with wavelengths of around a centimeter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 743590,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But now the wind can act on these ripples"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 746440,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "creating larger pressure differences"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 748420,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "between the front and the\ntop of the wave crest,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 751120,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "pulling them up into bigger waves."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 753910,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the interaction of\nthe wind with these waves"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 756130,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then creates even larger\npressure differences"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 758380,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and even larger waves."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 760750,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The waves are mostly\nuniform at this point,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 763360,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but as they interact with each other,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 765040,
    "dDurationMs": 3630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they create a range of\ndifferent wavelength waves."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 768670,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And as the wind keeps blowing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 770350,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "these waves begin breaking\ntransferring their kinetic energy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 773770,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "into swirling eddies that\ndissipate their energy as heat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 777850,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Once the energy dissipation matches"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 779980,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the energy input from the wind,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 782050,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the waves have reached their maximum size"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 785080,
    "dDurationMs": 3633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and this is known as\na fully developed sea."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 789670,
    "dDurationMs": 1972,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Miguel] So this is\ngonna be an irregular wave."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 791642,
    "dDurationMs": 1208,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] This is irregular?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 792850,
    "dDurationMs": 840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Irregular wave,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 793690,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so what you saw earlier\nwith the regular waves"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 795940,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "were one frequency, one amplitude."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 798040,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is what we call a spectra,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 800440,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or multiple frequencies\nand multiple amplitudes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 804040,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can see there's higher\nfrequency with the waves"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 806320,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that kind of go travel slower\nthan the low frequency waves."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 809740,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Those low frequency waves will\ntravel fast and overcome 'em"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 812410,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that's what's making 'em look peaky"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 813760,
    "dDurationMs": 2373,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or kind of dulling it out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 817570,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] What surprised me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 818830,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that the different oceans of the world"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 820690,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have different mixtures\nof wave frequencies"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 823240,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or different spectra,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 824890,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "depending on their geography\nand the types of storms"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 827650,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that occur there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 829000,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example, the North Sea and\nother small bodies of water"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 832180,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have a peakier spectrum,\nand this is due to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 835030,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the limited fetch of\nstorms that occur there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 838300,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the mid-Atlantic, a broader\nspectrum best describes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 841690,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the developing or\ndecaying open ocean waves"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 844510,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that you'd find there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 846070,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And in the North Atlantic,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 847630,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the steady wind across an open ocean"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 850000,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "produces the broadest\nspectrum of wind waves."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 853510,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So when testing, engineers\nfirst have to figure out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 856180,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where the ship will be deployed,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 857560,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and which spectra best\nmatch these locations"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 860530,
    "dDurationMs": 2133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "before creating them in the pool."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 863650,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For most people I think,\nan ocean is an ocean."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 866440,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But you're saying that there's sort of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 868270,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "different conditions\ndepending on where you are?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 870730,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- The destroyer when I was in command,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 872440,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we did an operation off\nthe coast of South Korea"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 874870,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the spring."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 876220,
    "dDurationMs": 3690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Very rough sea keeping conditions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 879910,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But then, when you're\ncrossing the Pacific,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 881830,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a lot of that is a lot calmer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 884350,
    "dDurationMs": 5274,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So again, you know from there\nto the coast of South Korea"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 889624,
    "dDurationMs": 3816,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the Arabian Gulf, all those\nvery different conditions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 893440,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Were there any conditions that were"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 895000,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "particularly rough for you?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 896860,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So my bed was actually\nin the middle of a room"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 901480,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the seas were so bad,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 902830,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and this was either\nSouth or East China Sea."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 905860,
    "dDurationMs": 2269,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The seas were so bad that one night,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 908129,
    "dDurationMs": 2201,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I woke up in the middle of the night"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 910330,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and my whole mattress with me on it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 912190,
    "dDurationMs": 2283,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was sliding off of my bed frame,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 915670,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that's a pretty\nsignificantly sized mattress."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 918730,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you can imagine the\nseas we were in that night."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 923470,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Much bigger than this would terrify me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 925300,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I know it probably looks benign, but..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 927540,
    "dDurationMs": 1450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(laughs)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 928990,
    "dDurationMs": 900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Much bigger than this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 929890,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think that model will\ntake a lot of water."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 933220,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Why do you care about how\nmuch water goes on the deck?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 936100,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So on the back of this DDG\nis a helicopter landing pad."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 939430,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They don't want any water on the deck"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 940900,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when a helicopter's about to land."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 942340,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's a big problem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 943990,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, that's one of\nthe tests that we do here"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 945670,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is we'll put cameras to look at the deck"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 947590,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and understand how much water washes on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 950710,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] Since I knew\nthey wouldn't wanna risk"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 952360,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "their fancy model in rough conditions,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 954640,
    "dDurationMs": 3243,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we brought along a little\nremote controlled boat to test."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 959680,
    "dDurationMs": 2050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah, I wouldn't be happy on that boat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 963280,
    "dDurationMs": 1853,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A lot of people would be getting seasick."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 968740,
    "dDurationMs": 1011,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Whoa!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 969751,
    "dDurationMs": 1229,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(Miguel laughs)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 970980,
    "dDurationMs": 1180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Oh no."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 972160,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Miguel] Is it gone?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 972993,
    "dDurationMs": 1099,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] It's gone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 974092,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Miguel] No, it's\nright there. It came up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 974925,
    "dDurationMs": 986,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's upside down."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 975911,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(laughs)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 976744,
    "dDurationMs": 1326,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It was totally gone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 978070,
    "dDurationMs": 2493,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was in the air, then it went under."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 982840,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, not all the models tested here"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 984970,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can be remote controlled."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 987070,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So on the carriage is where"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 988030,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we're gonna do captain model tests"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 989470,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where you can tether, put\npower and instrumentation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 991870,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "onto a model that can't hold it itself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 994030,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So usually the model go in\nthis moon bay right here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 997030,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] The models are hooked up here"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 998860,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then the whole lab\nspeeds over the waves"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1002010,
    "dDurationMs": 1653,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "towing the model underneath."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1005029,
    "dDurationMs": 1933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(pensive music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1006962,
    "dDurationMs": 2938,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(waves crashing)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1009900,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "People have been making\nships for thousands of years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1012360,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Mm-hm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1013193,
    "dDurationMs": 2767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Is there actually any innovation today?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1015960,
    "dDurationMs": 1170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Most definitely."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1017130,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So sometimes, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1018420,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "people say that's the\nway we've always done it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1020400,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then when you look into it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1021750,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there's some validity to some hair-brained ideas,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1024150,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And when we test them,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1025500,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that's why you cut your\ncost of doing a model test"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1028560,
    "dDurationMs": 1417,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "versus building the full thing and saying,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1029977,
    "dDurationMs": 1163,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Oh that didn't work.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1031140,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Every ship that's in the Navy's\nfleet has gone through here,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1034110,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "has gone through either our purview,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1036660,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or has been tested peripherally with us."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1039180,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But all of the Navy-owned ships"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1040800,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have been tested in this facility,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1042390,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and there is a ship out there\nwith a tumble home design"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1044460,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where if you look at this ship\nbehind you, it flares out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1047220,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this flare is usually\nwhat helps protect you from,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1049680,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when you start rolling, it\ngives you a reaction force"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1052050,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or helps push you back."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1054150,
    "dDurationMs": 3810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A tumble home is shaped, you\nknow, the opposite direction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1057960,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if you have a ship\nshaped in that direction,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1060150,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it doesn't have as much of a\nrestoring force when you roll."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1063030,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- But what is the idea with\nmaking a ship like that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1065520,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- There's a lot of different reasons"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1066600,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "why you want to change a hull design."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1068550,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Some of it is the above water signatures."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1070740,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's all about the\nshape and radar sections"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1073110,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and there's a lot that goes into that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1075510,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You always wanna be stealthier,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1076710,
    "dDurationMs": 1110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you always want to be faster,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1077820,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you always wanna have more power."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1079710,
    "dDurationMs": 2403,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's always what\nthe innovations come."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1084720,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] So most of\nthe sailors aren't aware"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1086880,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the work that's going\non in the background"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1088350,
    "dDurationMs": 2665,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to support what they do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1091015,
    "dDurationMs": 1865,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- When I was in the fleet,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1092880,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I've been in the Navy 27 years,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1095010,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I never had any idea,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1096630,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "certainly not the\nmagnitude of what they do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1099300,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm not exaggerating when I say"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1101340,
    "dDurationMs": 3093,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's impacted every ship\nand submarine in the fleet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1105910,
    "dDurationMs": 1673,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(waves crashing)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1107583,
    "dDurationMs": 2833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(electronic zoom)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1111510,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Hey, if you don't have a\nhuge wave pool in your house"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1114300,
    "dDurationMs": 1050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to test out wave physics,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1115350,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I suggest you check out Brilliant,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1117000,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the sponsor of this video."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1118710,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Brilliant is the best learning tool I know"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1120780,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for mastering concepts in math, science,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1122910,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and computer science."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1124230,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All their lessons are\nbuilt around interactivity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1127110,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just check out this one on buoyancy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1129360,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can adjust the size\nof void in this block"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1131580,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and see whether it sinks or floats,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1133650,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then you proceed through a series"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1135690,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of increasingly challenging\nquestions and simulations."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1139350,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, what I love about Brilliant"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1141150,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that it really gets me thinking."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1143190,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So when I complete a lesson,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1144720,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I feel a sense of accomplishment"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1146520,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because I figured it out myself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1148770,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this applies to their\nfundamentals courses"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1150780,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as well as to their more advanced topics."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1153270,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example, the wave principles"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1154890,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of superposition and interference"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1156960,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "also apply to their course\non quantum mechanics,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1159300,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which I found to be both engaging\nand really comprehensive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1163320,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is a great interactive"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1165240,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which forces you to deeply\nengage with the conditions"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1168120,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that lead to interference,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1170250,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a concept I know a lot of\nstudents struggle with."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1173970,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Brilliant keeps supporting Veritasium"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1176010,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think for two reasons."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1177750,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First, they know that viewers\nof this channel are smart"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1180330,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they want to understand things deeply."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1182310,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, a lot of you have already signed up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1184800,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And second, I know that some of you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1187350,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "haven't given it a try yet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1188850,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I guess my question is,\nwhat are you waiting for?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1191310,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can try it out for free right now"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1193590,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by going to brilliant.org/veritasium."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1196350,
    "dDurationMs": 1020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And finally,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1197370,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I wanna remind you that with\nthe holiday season coming up,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1199650,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can give the gift of Brilliant"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1201060,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to a friend or family member,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1202740,
    "dDurationMs": 3990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that clever person in your\nlife who is really into STEM."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1206730,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are courses tailored for anyone,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1208530,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "whether beginner,\nintermediate, or advanced."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1210900,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if you sign up right now,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1212250,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Brilliant are offering 20% off"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1213840,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "an annual premium subscription"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1215430,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the first 200 people to sign up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1217140,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just use my link brilliant.org/veritasium."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1220500,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I wanna thank Brilliant\nfor supporting Veritasium,"
